>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_FORCE_TAC`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.CS_FORCE_TAC :
  clasetLib.claset -> simpLib.simpset -> tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the claset- and simpset-explicit form of `FORCE_TAC`.

`CS_FORCE_TAC cs ss` clarifies using `cs`, simplifies using `ss`, and
solves every residue by first-applicable-goal best-first search with an
unsafe simp wrapper. The wrapper is inert during clarification because
clarification consults only safe wrappers.

This interface does not read global clasimp state or process a theorem
list. The caller must prepare the claset, simpset, and assumptions.

### Failure

Fails unless the pipeline closes the goal.

### Example

``` hol4
val force =
  clasimpLib.CS_FORCE_TAC
    (clasetLib.the_claset ()) (clasimpLib.clasimp_ss ());
```

